L0206 S: [ ] Swap the live exe per the WIN-10 workflow (move aside, rebuild, `/mcp` reload). 
P: - [ ] Pull `experiments` with Tasks 1–6 landed; build **default features** (lean lite — no `local-embed*`, no `server-stack`) natively (windows-gnu).
- [ ] Swap the live exe per the WIN-10 workflow (move aside, rebuild, `/mcp` reload).
