P: **Operational note:** kotlin muxes spawned by the OLD binary (e.g. the live `backend-kotlin` mux observed this session) keep writing to `~/.config/JetBrains/analyzer` until a `/mcp` restart loads the new binary; that pre-existing index is swept manually once its mux exits.
