P: To reproduce, check out commit 84d5dd6 on the experiments branch and bring up the retrieval stack. Trigger a full rebuild with the index build action, ideally after orphaning the index by renaming the project so there is real work. Poll the index status action while it runs. The done and total counters stay at zero throughout, while the Qdrant point count for the code chunks collection climbs steadily. Progress reporting is therefore broken, not the indexing itself. The reporting path is clearly sound, since the unit test for the status serializer passes.
