L0423 S: **Second-order finding, folded into the tracker.** A timed-out stage exits `124` and its downstream neighbours then see a clean EOF and exit `0` — so the pipeline reads as successful unless `PIPESTATUS` is consulted. 
P: **Second-order finding, folded into the tracker.** A timed-out stage exits `124` and its
